      "problem": "What is the $x$-coordinate of the point $P?$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/cf628679e0e9726a0db5d3399d992a0333911be16b8ccd89d2d6455e540ea3d9.png)",
